{"id":"d38664b9a0dc8443","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-tm-state.md","title":"Turing Machine State","display":"df-tm-state — Turing Machine State","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-tm-state","aliases":["88-df-tm-state"],"display":"df-tm-state — Turing Machine State","depends_on":["[[88-df-cardinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-tm-state"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-tm-state</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm-state — Turing Machine State"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3fb55f9cf4d73400\" href=\"?note=3fb55f9cf4d73400\" title=\"88-df-cardinality\">88-df-cardinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> (candidate state-code set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|Q|\">\\(|Q|\\)</span> (cardinality, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fb55f9cf4d73400\" href=\"?note=3fb55f9cf4d73400\" title=\"88-df-cardinality\">88-df-cardinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{\\mathrm{start}}, q_{\\mathrm{accept}}, q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\in Q\">\\(q_{\\mathrm{start}}, q_{\\mathrm{accept}}, q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\in Q\\)</span> (start/accept/reject states)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TMStates}(Q,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\">\\(\\mathrm{TMStates}(Q,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\\)</span> (state-system predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}state}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{TMStates}(Q,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nQ\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land 3\\leq|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\n\\land q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\in Q\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land q_{\\mathrm{start}}\\neq q_{\\mathrm{accept}}\n\\land q_{\\mathrm{start}}\\neq q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\n\\land q_{\\mathrm{accept}}\\neq q_{\\mathrm{reject}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}state}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{TMStates}(Q,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nQ\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land 3\\leq|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\n\\land q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\in Q\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land q_{\\mathrm{start}}\\neq q_{\\mathrm{accept}}\n\\land q_{\\mathrm{start}}\\neq q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\n\\land q_{\\mathrm{accept}}\\neq q_{\\mathrm{reject}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>状态集是有限的</li>\n<li>开始状态是非停机状态；转移函数的定义域只排除接受与拒绝状态</li>\n<li>接受状态和拒绝状态互异，且都不同于开始状态</li>\n<li>状态直接取为有限自然数代码集，保证整台有限机器可进一步编码为自然数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"3fb55f9cf4d73400","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"3fb55f9cf4d73400","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|Q|$ (cardinality, see [[88-df-cardinality]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"|Q|","display":false},{"tex":"q_{\\mathrm{start}}, q_{\\mathrm{accept}}, q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\in Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TMStates}(Q,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}state}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{TMStates}(Q,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nQ\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land 3\\leq|Q|<\\aleph_0\n\\land q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\in Q\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land q_{\\mathrm{start}}\\neq q_{\\mathrm{accept}}\n\\land q_{\\mathrm{start}}\\neq q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\n\\land q_{\\mathrm{accept}}\\neq q_{\\mathrm{reject}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1330,"backlinks":[{"id":"fb6aa5db0f2eb060","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$q \\in Q_M$ (current state, see [[88-df-tm-state]])"},{"id":"c9d922648d98305d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TMStates}(Q,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})$ (state system, see [[88-df-tm-state]])"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[88-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[88-df-classical-calculus.md]]\n[[88-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[88-df-compactness.md]]\n[[88-df-completeness.md]]\n[[88-df-computable-f